sequenceDiagram
    actor H as Hunter
    actor E as Employer
    participant AsC as AssignmentsController
    participant AsS as AssignmentService
    participant PS as PaymentService
    participant DB as SQL Server
    H->>AsC: POST /Assignments/Accept/{id}
    AsC->>AsS: AcceptAsync
    AsS->>DB: assignment=InProgress, job=InProgress, other applications=Rejected
    AsS->>PS: CreateFor(assignment) → Pending + PaymentEvent
    H->>AsC: POST /Assignments/Submit/{id} (description, link/file)
    AsC->>AsS: SubmitAsync
    AsS->>DB: INSERT WorkSubmission vN (server timestamp), assignment=Submitted
    AsS->>PS: Transition → AwaitingApproval
    alt changes needed
        E->>AsC: POST RequestRevision (reason)
        AsS->>DB: submission=RevisionRequested, assignment=RevisionRequested
        AsS->>PS: Transition → Pending
    else accepted
        E->>AsC: POST Approve
        AsS->>DB: submission=Approved, assignment=Completed, job=Completed
        AsS->>PS: Transition → Approved
        E->>AsC: POST /Payments/MarkPaid (method, reference)
        PS->>DB: payment=Paid (simulated) + PaymentEvent
    end
